WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,620 --> 00:00:07,620
He was either sleeping or typing along the way.

2
00:00:07,620 --> 00:00:09,020
No chance to talk at all

3
00:00:09,020 --> 00:00:10,220
After he comes back

4
00:00:10,220 --> 00:00:11,820
Can I still stay in this home?

5
00:00:11,820 --> 00:00:13,620
if he doesn't like me

6
00:00:13,620 --> 00:00:15,220
Who will mom and dad choose?

7
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:19,060
Mom, dad, second brother, you are back

8
00:00:19,060 --> 00:00:25,030
Xiaoyun, this is sister Wen Chen

9
00:00:25,030 --> 00:00:28,500
No need, just call me Wen Chen

10
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:34,260
You and Xiaoyun will be sisters from now on

11
00:00:34,260 --> 00:00:36,060
They are all children of the Su family

12
00:00:36,060 --> 00:00:39,530
Xiaochen has just returned home and is still not used to it.

13
00:00:39,530 --> 00:00:40,730
Take your time

14
00:00:40,730 --> 00:00:48,910
Let's talk

15
00:00:48,910 --> 00:00:51,620
What are you going to do with my identity?

16
00:00:51,820 --> 00:00:54,220
I will call you the adopted daughter of the Su family to the outside world.

17
00:00:54,220 --> 00:00:57,800
Dad, we agreed

18
00:00:57,800 --> 00:01:02,660
The Su family cannot have a daughter with bad conduct.

19
00:01:02,660 --> 00:01:03,660
As mentioned before

20
00:01:03,660 --> 00:01:06,480
Just call them twins

21
00:01:06,480 --> 00:01:07,680
no matter what

22
00:01:07,680 --> 00:01:10,000
I am still the daughter of the Su family

23
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:12,000
Trying your best to find me back

24
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:16,540
And refused to admit it

25
00:01:16,540 --> 00:01:18,920
What are you

26
00:01:18,920 --> 00:01:20,320
The Su family doesn’t want to admit it

27
00:01:20,320 --> 00:01:22,120
I just don’t want to come back either

28
00:01:22,120 --> 00:01:24,260
hit it off

29
00:01:24,260 --> 00:01:26,060
Yufu returns the favor to you

30
00:01:26,060 --> 00:01:27,260
from now on

31
00:01:27,260 --> 00:01:28,460
We are parents

32
00:01:32,530 --> 00:01:34,930
Unbreakable, fake

33
00:01:34,930 --> 00:01:36,530
If you don’t want to go back to Su’s house, just leave

34
00:01:36,530 --> 00:01:54,710
The Su family will never recognize you

35
00:01:54,710 --> 00:01:56,830
Two years ago it was tens of thousands

36
00:01:56,830 --> 00:01:59,300
Where did he get Qian Xiaochen?

37
00:01:59,300 --> 00:02:00,300
Dad has a bad temper

38
00:02:00,300 --> 00:02:01,760
Don't worry about it

39
00:02:01,760 --> 00:02:02,960
He has nothing to do with me

40
00:02:02,960 --> 00:02:06,770
Write it off after today

41
00:02:06,770 --> 00:02:07,970
where are you going so late

42
00:02:07,970 --> 00:02:09,260
I'll give it to you

43
00:02:09,260 --> 00:02:10,460
There is a suite in the eating center

44
00:02:10,460 --> 00:02:11,920
You live there first

45
00:02:11,920 --> 00:02:17,160
No trouble, Wenwen
